WEBVTT

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:52.920
In the early 21st century, there was less hatred and conflict, and nature was trying to regain its beauty.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:59.130
The wishes of all living things on this planet, peace, were finally about to be fulfilled.

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:02.910
However, the first episode has begun.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.160
The monster is heading towards the village.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:04.120
Let's hide in the traffic lights.

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:06.140
We have to find a way to kill the monster.

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:42.690
The GPC is an international organization that protects the Earth from unknown sea phenomena and natural disasters.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:50.860
It has research centers all over the world and has a lunar base and a space station.

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:54.870
The General Headquarters of the GPC is here in Japan.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:08.300
G.U.T.S. is a team of experts that specializes in top-down phenomena in the Earth Peace Alliance.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:14.200
Is this the meteorite of the problem?

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:16.500
It's a telemeter.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:47.980
It's not a relic. It was made.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:08.760
What?

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:09.780
What is it?

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:25.560
It's a hologram.

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:34.830
I might be able to translate it with a sound translator.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.800
Good night.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:48.240
Good night.

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:57.580
I'm the captain of the rescue team, Yuzaru.

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.570
This time capsule...

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:04.560
When you arrive on Earth, there will be a great change on Earth.

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:13.500
As a sign of that, the monster Golza, who shakes the earth, and the monster Melba, who cuts through the sky, will be revived.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:17.620
It's Golza! The one who appeared in Mongolia is Golza!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:22.920
The only one who can protect the Earth from the great change is the evil titan.

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:28.260
The titan, who used to be the guardian of the Earth, used his body to fight.

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:34.900
and hide it in the Tiga Pyramid to become the original form of light.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:39.710
Return to the West, my ancestors.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:44.360
We must revive the titans and defeat Golza and Melba.

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:48.800
There is only one way to revive the titans.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:59.120
Dr. Kashmir.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:00.240
What do you think?

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:01.880
It's a Time Capsule with a solar system.

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.130
It's a mess.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:07.940
It's real.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:10.360
They're saying that Golza will appear.

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:13.360
It's not just Golza.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:15.170
It's Mereba.

00:07:15.270 --> 00:07:16.300
Captain Daigo.

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:19.240
To believe in this Time Capsule means that

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:23.040
there was a civilization with better science than us in the past.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.760
I looked up the radioactive elements of the meteorite that covered the crystal.

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:50.060
It's made of the soil from the 21st century to the 38th century.

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:53.840
About 30 million years ago,

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:56.160
the third generation of the new generation, Zanshin,

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.780
that is, the human race, appeared on Earth.

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:00.810
That's a long time ago.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.410
No way...

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:09.260
A monster has appeared on the island.

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:11.140
I'll send you a video of the landing camera.

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:21.070
It's Melba!

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:24.200
It's a fake monster, Melba.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:26.660
Why is there a monster now?

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:28.950
Something's wrong with the Earth.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:33.270
Yuzare was right. The time capsule is real.

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:39.080
The only thing left is the Titan of Tiga.

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:42.260
The Titan of Tiga? Where is Tiga?

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:48.740
Tiga is there. I'll show you now.

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:09.390
According to the analysis of the ancient language, the land of Tiga is currently in the Tohoku region of Japan.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:13.980
In order to search for the pyramid of Tiga at once,

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:21.080
Vice Captain Munakata, Daigo, Rena, Hori, and Shinjo's members appeared in two Gatsby.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.080
Is there really a pyramid in a place like this?

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:47.180
Be careful. Keep in touch with each other.

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:54.420
Munagata.

00:10:34.924 --> 00:10:35.924
Thank you.

00:10:47.948 --> 00:10:49.948
Are you okay?

00:10:50.956 --> 00:10:51.456
Yes?

00:10:54.252 --> 00:10:56.252
Is this really TIGA?

00:10:56.748 --> 00:10:59.988
A pyramid that looks like a giant is a satellite camera.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.300
It's impossible not to be able to detect it.

00:11:20.348 --> 00:11:22.348
Thank you for watching!

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:08.900
Just now, in the north of Akita prefecture

00:12:08.956 --> 00:12:11.896
A giant creature over 50 meters in length appeared.

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:15.500
It is moving northward while destroying buildings and houses.

00:12:16.476 --> 00:12:23.636
TPC is investigating whether this creature is the same as the unidentified creature that appeared in Mongolia this morning.

00:12:23.836 --> 00:12:26.236
They are calling for evacuation to the nearby residents.

00:13:14.748 --> 00:13:16.748
The last one!

00:13:28.028 --> 00:13:28.528
Of course.

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:04.320
We have to fix the noise.

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:16.020
As Yuzare predicted, Golza and Nerva, who returned to Earth, were moving towards the Pyramid of Fire as promised.

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:20.830
I got it. What are we going to do?

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:23.380
The dynamite carrier is heading that way.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:24.590
Roger that.

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:26.670
We're going to deploy a deterrent in the police station.

00:14:30.540 --> 00:14:31.540
I'm retreating from here.

00:14:32.364 --> 00:14:33.864
Golza and Nerva are coming this far.

00:14:33.864 --> 00:14:34.504
Where's the titan?

00:14:35.884 --> 00:14:37.524
I can't believe I'm alive.

00:14:38.028 --> 00:14:38.528
I can't help it.

00:14:38.732 --> 00:14:40.192
I can't fix the noise part.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:17.730
I'm going to die.

00:16:33.004 --> 00:16:33.504
Hey!

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:52.740
At the moment when he was about to fall, the 5th unit became light and overflowed into the giant's body.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:57.920
By selling the life of the 5th unit, the giant woke up from a long sleep.

00:21:17.372 --> 00:21:18.272
I was worried.

00:21:18.524 --> 00:21:19.484
What happened?

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:21.460
The exhaust lever is broken.

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:24.940
He's a good guy.

00:21:26.396 --> 00:21:26.896
Let's go!

00:21:27.004 --> 00:21:28.364
Let's get started!

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:07.180
That titan's name is Ultraman!

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:09.720
Ultraman?

00:23:54.780 --> 00:23:55.120
What is the secret to Daigo?

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:57.440
What is the secret to Daigo?

00:23:58.690 --> 00:23:59.670
What is the secret to Daigo?

00:24:00.350 --> 00:24:02.150
GATS' ride mecha is also powered up.

00:24:02.610 --> 00:24:04.800
Next time on Ultraman TIGA,

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:05.950
The Stone Myth.

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:07.000
Stay tuned!
